{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logos/7e26e4e3fd5f96de13bfb3e3c6b600af.png",
  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 20px auto; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12.96px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: Ovo, serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(92, 92, 76); text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Founded in 2019, Santisima is a small, family-run boutique which curates jewelry inspired by ancient craftsmanship and archetypal symbology. All of our pieces are designed by hand with precious gemstones and motifs inspired by Greek, Roman and Egyptian art.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 20px auto; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12.96px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: Ovo, serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(92, 92, 76); text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">The journey of our pieces is a collaboration between ourselves and our wearers. We provide pieces with meaning, which they use to express their moments of significance. Since our inception, we have believed in crafting our jewelry with integrity and have realized this goal by only using ethically sourced materials and silversmiths with a dedication to their craft.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Product description:</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0.5em; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12.96px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: Ovo, serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(40, 44, 46); text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">FAIR PRICING</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0.5em; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12.96px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: Ovo, serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(40, 44, 46); text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Say goodbye to traditional 10x markups. We design fine jewelry that you can wear every single day.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0.5em; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12.96px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: Ovo, serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(40, 44, 46); text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">HIGH QUALITY</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0.5em; padding: 0px; border-width: 0px; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12.96px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: Ovo, serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(40, 44, 46); text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">We work with expert jewelers who use high-quality and enduring materials, from precious metals&mdash;such as recycled and responsibly mined gold&mdash;to ethically sourced AAA-grade gemstones.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): Opportunity to increase commission %&nbsp;<br>&bull; Payment terms: 1st of the month<br>&bull; Other information:</p>\r\n</div>",
